 class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-description\">Brief Description <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <textarea class=\"form-control-enhanced\" id=\"ind-description\" name=\"ind-description\" rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"Please provide a brief description about yourself and your interest in joining the mission\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-cv\">CV <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"file\" id=\"ind-cv\" name=\"ind-cv\" accept=\".pdf,.doc,.docx\" required=\"\"> <small class=\"form-text text-muted\">Please upload your CV (PDF, DOC, or DOCX format, max 5MB)</small></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-contact\">Contact Details <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"text\" id=\"ind-contact\" name=\"ind-contact\" placeholder=\"Phone number, Email, or other contact information\" required=\"\"></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-address\">Address <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <textarea class=\"form-control-enhanced\" id=\"ind-address\" name=\"ind-address\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Your complete address\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-linkedin\">LinkedIn URL</label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"url\" id=\"ind-linkedin\" name=\"ind-linkedin\" placeholder=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/yourprofile\"></div><div class=\"text-center\"><button class=\"btn-submit-enhanced\" type=\"submit\">\r\n                                      <span>Submit</span>\r\n                                      <i class=\"fas fa-paper-plane\"></i>\r\n                                    </button></div></form></div></div></div></div><script>\r\n// Ensure modals are hidden on page load\r\ndocument.addEventListener(\'DOMContentLoaded\', function() {\r\n  // Initialize modals