o collaborate\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"org-contact\">Contact Details <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"text\" id=\"org-contact\" name=\"org-contact\" placeholder=\"Phone number, Email, or other contact information\" required=\"\"></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"org-address\">Address <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <textarea class=\"form-control-enhanced\" id=\"org-address\" name=\"org-address\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Complete address of your organization\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"org-website\">Website Link</label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"url\" id=\"org-website\" name=\"org-website\" placeholder=\"https://www.example.com\"></div><div class=\"text-center\"><button class=\"btn-submit-enhanced\" type=\"submit\">\r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      <span>Submit</span>\r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      <i class=\"fas fa-paper-plane\"></i>\r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </button></div></form></div></div></div></div><p><!-- Individual Form Modal -->&nbsp;</p><div class=\"join-form-modal\" id=\"individualModal\"><div class=\"modal-backdrop\" onclick=\"closeIndividualModal()\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"modal-dialog\"><div class=\"modal-content\"><div class=\"modal-header\"><h2 class=\"modal-title\">Individual Application Form</h2><p><button class=\"modal-close-btn\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"closeIndividualModal()\" aria-label=\"Close\">\r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      <i class=\"fas fa-times\"></i>\r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </button></p></div><div class=\"modal-body\"><form class=\"contact-form\" id=\"individualForm\"><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-name\">Name <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"text\" id=\"ind-name\" name=\"ind-name\" required=\"\"></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-area-expertise\">Area of Expertise/Interest <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"text\" id=\"ind-area-expertise\" name=\"ind-area-expertise\" placeholder=\"e.g., Public Policy, Digital Governance, Training &amp; Development\" required=\"\"></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-description\">Brief Description <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <textarea class=\"form-control-enhanced\" id=\"ind-description\" name=\"ind-description\" rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"Please provide a brief description about yourself and your interest in joining the mission\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-cv\">CV <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input cla