item\" style=\"padding-left:32px;\" href=\"pages/frameworks/large-scale-interventions.html\">Large Scale Interventions</a></div></li></ul></li><li class=\"nav-item dropdown\"><a class=\"nav-link dropdown-toggle\" href=\"pages/services/mdos.html\" id=\"servicesDropdown\" role=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Services&nbsp;</a><ul class=\"dropdown-menu\" aria-labelledby=\"servicesDropdown\"><li><div class=\"knowledge-icon\"><a class=\"dropdown-item knowledge-item\" href=\"pages/services/mdos.html\"><i class=\"fas fa-building\"></i></a></div><div class=\"knowledge-content\"><div class=\"knowledge-title\"><a class=\"dropdown-item knowledge-item\" href=\"pages/services/mdos.html\">Ministries, Departments and Organizations (MDOs)</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"knowledge-icon\"><a class=\"dropdown-item knowledge-item\" href=\"pages/services/states-ut.html\"><i class=\"fas fa-map-marked-alt\"></i></a></div><div class=\"knowledge-content\"><div class=\"knowledge-title\"><a class=\"dropdown-item knowledge-item\" href=\"pages/services/states-ut.html\">States and Union Territories (UTs)</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"knowledge-icon\"><a class=\"dropdown-item knowledge-item\" href=\"pages/services/training-institutes.html\"><i class=\"fas fa-graduation-cap\"></i></a></div><div class=\"knowledge-content\"><div class=\"knowledge-title\"><a class=\"dropdown-item knowledge-item\" href=\"pages/services/training-institutes.html\">Central &amp; Administrative Training Institutes (CTIs &amp; ATIs)</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"knowledge-icon\"><a class=\"dropdown-item knowledge-item\" href=\"pages/about/join-mission.html\"><i class=\"fas fa-briefcase\"></i></a></div><div class=\"knowledge-content\"><div class=\"knowledge-title\"><a class=\"dropdown-item knowledge-item\" href=\"pages/about/join-mission.html\">Work @CBC</a></div></div></li></ul></li><li class=\"nav-item dropdown\"><a class=\"nav-link dropdown-toggle\" href=\"pages/initiativ