eful Links</h3><ul><li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"pages/about/about-cbc.html\">About CBC</a></li><li><a href=\"pages/about/team-cbc.html\">Our Team</a></li><li><a href=\"pages/newsletters.html\">Newsletters</a></li><li><a href=\"pages/tender.html\">Tender</a></li><li><a href=\"pages/circulars-notices.html\">Circulars/Notices</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"footer-links\"><h3>Quick Links</h3><ul><li><a href=\"pages/mission-karmayogi.html\">Mission Karmayogi</a></li><li><a href=\"#\">iGOT Portal</a></li><li><a href=\"pages/gallery.html\">Gallery</a></li><li><a href=\"pages/events.html\">Events</a></li><li><a href=\"pages/about/contact.html\">Contact Us</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"footer-contact\"><h3>Contact Us</h3><p><i class=\"fas fa-map-marker-alt\"></i> 7th Floor, NDCC-II Building, New Delhi, India</p><p><i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt\"></i> +91 11 2309 3200</p><p><i class=\"fas fa-envelope\"></i> info@cbc.gov.in</p><div class=\"visit-stats\"><p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> 31 Oct 2025</p><p><strong>Visitors:</strong> 2,213,098</p></div></div></div></footer><div class=\"accessibility-drawer\" id=\"accessibilityDrawer\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"Accessibility Options\" aria-modal=\"true\"><div class=\"accessibility-header\"><h2><i class=\"fas fa-universal-access\"></i> Accessibility Options</h2><p><button class=\"accessibility-close-btn\" id=\"closeAccessibilityBtn\" aria-label=\"Close Accessibility Menu\">\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-times\"></i>\r\n      </button></p></div><div class=\"accessibility-content\"><div class=\"accessibility-section\"><h3><i class=\"fas fa-text-height\"></i> Text Size</h3><div class=\"text-size-controls\"><button class=\"text-size-btn high-contrast-border\" data-size=\"small\" aria-label=\"Small Text Size\"><span>A-</span></button> <button class=\"text-size-btn high-contrast-border active\" data-size=\"normal\" aria-label=\"Normal Text Size\"><span>A</span></button> <button class=\"text-size-btn high-contr