('hero_section', 0, 19, 23, 'en', 0, '<p>A comprehensive program focused on instilling Seva Bhaav (spirit of service) and Svadharma (duty aligned with personal purpose) among civil servants to enhance citizen service delivery.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
