(14, 'en', 'help_search', ' creating a new contact form goal create a new sitewide contact form steps in the manage administrative menu navigate to structure   contact forms  click add contact form  fill in the label  title for the form  recipients  and optionally the other settings click save  you should see your new contact form in the table along with a link to view it the contact form will always have subject and message fields if you want to add more fields follow the steps in managing the fields of contact forms  ', 0),
