(16, 'en', 'help_search', ' setting a default contact form goal set a sitewide contact form to be the default contact form  the form displayed on the default contact page  for example   contact   steps in the manage administrative menu navigate to structure   contact forms  click edit for the sitewide form you want to be the default check make this the default form and click save   ', 0),
