(30, 'en', 'help_search', ' tracking the content of your website tracking overview the core history module tracks how recently users have viewed content items and provides a views field and filter that can be used to show users content that they haven t yet seen if you have one or more tracking modules installed on your site see the related topics listed below for specific tasks  ', 0),
