(70, 'en', 'help_search', ' reordering and disabling menu links goal disable menu links or change the order and hierarchy of menu links steps in the manage administration menu navigate to structure  menus click edit menu for the menu that you want to edit drag menu links into a new order or check uncheck enabled to enable or disable menu links click save to save your changes  ', 0),
